cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use atomx in research, please cite this software. Add the Zenodo DOI after publication."
type: software
title: "atomx: Relativistic Atomic Structure, Spectroscopy, and X-ray Dynamics"
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Zezhong
repository-code: "https://github.com/zezhong-zhang/atomx"
url: "https://github.com/zezhong-zhang/atomx"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A Python library for relativistic atomic structure, spectroscopy, and
  X-ray dynamics, with shared physical operators, B-spline and shooting
  numerical engines, and explicit model and convergence contracts.
keywords:
  - atomic physics
  - relativistic atomic structure
  - configuration interaction
  - atomic spectroscopy
  - XFEL dynamics
